- Update to 0.5.11:
  * 37 new documented nodes: TRELLIS 2 (conditioning, shape,
    texture and upsample stages plus the VAE decoders), 3D mesh
    editing (remesh, decimate, unwrap, weld, smooth normals,
    paint, ambient-occlusion/normal-map/texture baking, render,
    UV atlas), ByteDance Seedream V3, 2Reference V2 and video
    enhance, FishAudio text-to-speech, speech-to-text and voice
    cloning, and Flux video upscale
  * 431 existing node en.md files refreshed and their
    translations regenerated for all 12 locales
  * Nodes with dynamic combo inputs now document their grouped
    input format, and translated docs use the frontend's own
    parameter-name translations
  * Chinese: "sigmas" was mistranslated as "variance"

